; Bob leaks, then Alice pays. The whole trace is a trace of "bob MUST_NOT leak
; THEN alice MUST pay" with the outcome DONE, since the prohibition completes at
; once; but its prefix up to the leak, entry 1, is a violated trace. The
; violation takes precedence over DONE (formal/core/CORE.md, decision 34). The
; leak comes before Alice pays, so "alice MUST pay THEN bob MUST_NOT leak" is
; not violated.
(scenario sequence_violation_then_done
  (spec "examples/core/core_sequence.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z" (act bob leak must_not)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T11:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data)))
